{
  "id": "the-simpsons---5x05---treehouse-of-horror-iv",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 5x05 - Treehouse of Horror IV",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 5x05 - Treehouse of Horror IV.en.sub",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-13T03:32:08.114Z",
  "lineCount": 283,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[ Ghostly Shriek ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 8080,
      "endMs": 11420
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[ Evil Laughter ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 17880,
      "endMs": 19800
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "[ Gunfire ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 20290,
      "endMs": 21590
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[ All Moaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 23410,
      "endMs": 25630
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Paintings: Lifeless images rendered in colorful goop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33830,
      "endMs": 38790
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "But at night, they take on a life of their own.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39160,
      "endMs": 42550
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "They become portals to hell... so scary and horrible and gruesome that-- Bart, you should warn people this episode is very frightening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42900,
      "endMs": 49710
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Maybe they'd rather listen to that War of the Worlds broadcast on N.P.R., hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49950,
      "endMs": 53720
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Yes, Mother. Good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 54010,
      "endMs": 55610
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Now, you hold Maggie. I'm going to buy some earrings at the gift shop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55610,
      "endMs": 58920
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] The subject of our first painting tonight is the most... foul, evil, vicious, diabolical beast to stalk the earth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 59210,
      "endMs": 67280
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Of course, I refer to--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67800,
      "endMs": 69340
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "[ Muffled ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 69510,
      "endMs": 71340
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "The devil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72370,
      "endMs": 75100
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "And next in our fall catalog-- we love this-- it is a vision in raspberry cream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80190,
      "endMs": 85040
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "[ Applause ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 85440,
      "endMs": 87490
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Ohh! Pure genius.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87490,
      "endMs": 91240
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "[ Gurgling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 91850,
      "endMs": 93670
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Oh! And now to make the leap from dreams to reality.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94090,
      "endMs": 98270
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Sorry, Homer. While you were daydreaming, we ate all the doughnuts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99260,
      "endMs": 102090
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Well, there were a few left, but we chucked 'em at an old man for kicks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102350,
      "endMs": 105840
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Damn buzzards! I ain't dead yet!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107010,
      "endMs": 108800
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "All right. Stay calm. Remember your training.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109350,
      "endMs": 112840
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "''Dear Homer, I.O.U. one emergency doughnut. Signed, Homer.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115680,
      "endMs": 119690
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Bastard! He's always one step ahead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120060,
      "endMs": 122420
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Oh! I'd sell my soul for a doughnut!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123360,
      "endMs": 125790
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "[ Rumbling ] Well, that can be arranged.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126840,
      "endMs": 128490
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Flanders! You're the devil?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129010,
      "endMs": 131150
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "It's always the one you least suspect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131730,
      "endMs": 133810
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Now, many people offer to sell their souls... without reflecting upon the grave ramifica--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134160,
      "endMs": 138680
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Do you have a doughnut or not? Coming up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139010,
      "endMs": 140820
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Just sign here. Careful, hot pen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141070,
      "endMs": 142890
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Hmm. Who's that goat-legged fellow? I like the cut of his jib.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145760,
      "endMs": 148640
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Uh, Prince of Darkness, sir. He's your 1 1 :00.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149140,
      "endMs": 151120
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Ah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151430,
      "endMs": 154970
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Now, remember, the instant you finish it, I own your soul for-- Hey, wait, if I don't finish this last bite... you don't get my soul, do you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157050,
      "endMs": 167150
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Uh, technically no, but---- I'm smarter than the devil! I'm smarter than the dev-- You are not smarter than me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167320,
      "endMs": 174430
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "I'll see you in hell yet, Homer Simpson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174740,
      "endMs": 178600
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Not likely. [ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180840,
      "endMs": 182800
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "[ Muttering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 186840,
      "endMs": 188550
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Hm. Hm. Hm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190150,
      "endMs": 192550
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Mmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193390,
      "endMs": 194410
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Mmm! Forbidden doughnut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194520,
      "endMs": 197470
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Hmm? Well, well. Finishing something?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 198770,
      "endMs": 201390
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "[ Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 201390,
      "endMs": 202630
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "[ Whimpering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 203620,
      "endMs": 205130
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "[ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 207050,
      "endMs": 208190
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Homer, did you eat that doughnut? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208430,
      "endMs": 210460
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Your wide behind won't save you this time. Hey, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213420,
      "endMs": 216840
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Hey. Wait!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216840,
      "endMs": 218060
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Doesn't my father have the right to a fair trial?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218400,
      "endMs": 220340
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Oh, you Americans with your ''due process'' and ''fair trials.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220340,
      "endMs": 224150
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "This is always so much easier in Mexico. All right. Very well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224580,
      "endMs": 228090
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "We'll have the trial tomorrow at the stroke of midnight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228760,
      "endMs": 231820
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Till then, you're going to spend the day in hell!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232230,
      "endMs": 234440
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 237160,
      "endMs": 239990
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] That wasn't so bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245540,
      "endMs": 246970
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Huh? Ow! Ow! Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247480,
      "endMs": 250600
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "So, you like doughnuts, eh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256060,
      "endMs": 258800
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Uh-huh. Well... have all the doughnuts in the world!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258800,
      "endMs": 263200
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "[ Cackling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 264470,
      "endMs": 266290
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "More. Mmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 274450,
      "endMs": 276110
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "I don't understand it. James Coco went mad in 1 5 minutes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 277210,
      "endMs": 280640
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "[ Chiming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 284060,
      "endMs": 285980
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Homer, are you all right? No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288550,
      "endMs": 291100
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Mr. Simpson, don't you worry. I watched Matlock in a bar last night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291410,
      "endMs": 294270
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "The sound wasn't on, but I think I got the gist of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294620,
      "endMs": 296730
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Hear ye! Hear ye!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 303210,
      "endMs": 305140
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "The Court of Infernal Affairs is now in session.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305750,
      "endMs": 308820
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Very well. But first, some ground rules.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309310,
      "endMs": 311420
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Number one: We get bathroom breaks every half hour.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311770,
      "endMs": 313560
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Agreed. Number two: The jury will be chosen by me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314010,
      "endMs": 316440
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Agreed. No, wait!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316920,
      "endMs": 318510
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Silence! I give you the jury of the damned!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 318880,
      "endMs": 322420
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Benedict Arnold. Lizzie Borden. Richard Nixon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322990,
      "endMs": 326180
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "But I'm not dead yet. In fact, I just wrote an article for Redbook.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326940,
      "endMs": 329810
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Hey, listen, I did a favor for you. Yes, master.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330190,
      "endMs": 332660
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "John Wilkes Booth. Blackbeard the Pirate.John Dillinger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 333080,
      "endMs": 336230
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "And the starting line of the 1 97 6 Philadelphia Flyers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336670,
      "endMs": 339920
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] [ Chattering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340580,
      "endMs": 342540
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Mr. Blackbeard. We're low on chairs, and this is the last one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349160,
      "endMs": 354010
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Arr! This chair be high, says I.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354410,
      "endMs": 357190
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "[ Clears Throat ] I hold here a contract between myself and one Homer Simpson... pledging me his soul for a doughnut!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358640,
      "endMs": 365870
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Which I delivered! And it was scrum-didilly-umptious.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 366310,
      "endMs": 369240
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I simply ask for what is mine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370720,
      "endMs": 372880
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "[ Murmuring ] That was a right pretty speech, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374810,
      "endMs": 377350
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "But I ask you, what is a contract?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377670,
      "endMs": 379150
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Webster's defines it as ''an agreement under the law which is unbreakable.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379620,
      "endMs": 382880
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "''Which is unbreakable''!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383370,
      "endMs": 385810
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Excuse me. I must use the restroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388560,
      "endMs": 390310
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "[ Door Slams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 393190,
      "endMs": 394230
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Uh, Mr. Hutz?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396080,
      "endMs": 397760
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Homer Simpson, I have no choice... but to sentence you to an eternity of-- Wait! Before you send him to hell, there's something you should see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400640,
      "endMs": 409940
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "That's a photo of Homer and me at our wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410900,
      "endMs": 412760
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Wait a minute. You got married in an emergency room?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415130,
      "endMs": 416990
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Well, Homer ate the entire wedding cake by himself... before the wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417320,
      "endMs": 422850
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Read the back! The back!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424430,
      "endMs": 426260
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "''Dear Marge, You have given me your hand in marriage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426350,
      "endMs": 428400
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "''All I can give you in return is my soul... which I pledge to you forever.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428850,
      "endMs": 434460
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "[ Murmuring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 435370,
      "endMs": 436330
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "We've heard enough. Your Honor... we find that Homer Simpson's soul is legally the property... of Marge Simpson and not of the devil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 437160,
      "endMs": 444170
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "[ Groans ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 444450,
      "endMs": 445280
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Yea! Whoo-hoo-- Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445610,
      "endMs": 447420
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "All right, Simpson. You get your soul back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449720,
      "endMs": 452090
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "But let that ill-gotten doughnut be forever on your head.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453280,
      "endMs": 456790
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "[ Homer Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 457990,
      "endMs": 459760
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "[ Homer Chewing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 463860,
      "endMs": 465500
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Homer, stop picking at it. Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468170,
      "endMs": 470230
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "But I'm so sweet and tasty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470600,
      "endMs": 472630
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] Well, time to go to work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473010,
      "endMs": 474670
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Dad, I wouldn't go outside if I were you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474670,
      "endMs": 476430
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Don't worry, boys. He's gotta come out of there sometime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476620,
      "endMs": 479270
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "The next exhibit in our ghoulish gallery is entitled-- the ''School Bus''?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480250,
      "endMs": 486090
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Oh! Oh! They must mean the ''Ghoul Bus.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486310,
      "endMs": 490200
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Nope. It says right there, ''School Bus.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490740,
      "endMs": 492710
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Well, there's nothing scarier than having to go to school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493170,
      "endMs": 496150
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 496980,
      "endMs": 498530
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Hey, Bart, look! Krusty trading cards!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508770,
      "endMs": 511830
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "The long-awaited Eighth Series!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 512210,
      "endMs": 514400
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "[ Bart ] ''Krusty visits relatives in Annapolis, Maryland. '' ''Krusty poses for trading card photo. '' Hmm. He seems to be running a little low on ideas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514860,
      "endMs": 523570
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Well, at least you got the gum. Oww! I cut my cheek!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523950,
      "endMs": 527810
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Whoa! Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530160,
      "endMs": 533350
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "[ Screaming ] [ Horn Blaring ] Oh-- I hope this is sweat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534860,
      "endMs": 539390
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Bart, what's wrong?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540500,
      "endMs": 541750
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "I just had a vision of my own horrible, fiery death.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542160,
      "endMs": 545640
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "And? Lisa, your brother's obviously had a nightmare.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546230,
      "endMs": 549240
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Don't worry, honey. The scary part's over. [ Horn Blaring ] Marge, look at all this great stuff I found at the marina!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550010,
      "endMs": 556340
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "It was just sitting in some guy's boat. [ Horn Blaring ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556680,
      "endMs": 559450
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Hello, Simpson. I'm riding the bus because Mother hid my car keys... to punish me for talking to a woman on the phone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562610,
      "endMs": 567990
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "She was right to do it. Excuse me. Bart's a little upset this morning... so could everyone please be extra-nice to him?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568320,
      "endMs": 573540
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "[ All Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 574100,
      "endMs": 576320
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Hey, where's your diaper, baby?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 576780,
      "endMs": 579310
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Thank goodness he's drawn attention away from my shirt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579810,
      "endMs": 582810
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "[ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 585190,
      "endMs": 587100
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "[ Snarling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 589760,
      "endMs": 591050
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Milhouse! Milhouse, wake up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596050,
      "endMs": 598040
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Quick, look out the window. No way, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598440,
      "endMs": 600400
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "If I lean over, I leave myself open to wedgies, wet willies... or even the dreaded rear admiral.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 600850,
      "endMs": 607390
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Otto, you gotta do something! There's a gremlin on the side of the bus!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608980,
      "endMs": 612090
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Hey, no problemo, Bart-dude. I'll get rid of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614830,
      "endMs": 617760
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "No! Oh, no. I just made my last payment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619530,
      "endMs": 622660
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624420,
      "endMs": 625400
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "[ Screams ] Everybody!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634030,
      "endMs": 634800
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "There's a monster on the side of the bus!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635260,
      "endMs": 637430
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "[ Yelling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 637920,
      "endMs": 639940
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Hey, there's no monster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 640500,
      "endMs": 642510
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "You're deceptive. I don't see anything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643040,
      "endMs": 645230
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Hey, who's driving the bus?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645640,
      "endMs": 647720
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Ooh! Una momento, por favor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 648160,
      "endMs": 650470
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Now, I've gotten word that a child is using his imagination... and I've come to put a stop to it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650800,
      "endMs": 654760
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "No! No, it's true! There's a monster on the bus. The only monster on this bus... is a lack of proper respect for the rules.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 655200,
      "endMs": 660370
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660910,
      "endMs": 662860
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "[ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 664860,
      "endMs": 666590
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 669120,
      "endMs": 670980
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Ach. Me mule wouldn't walk in the mud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673170,
      "endMs": 674960
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "So I had to put 1 7 bullets in him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675540,
      "endMs": 677340
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "[ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 678200,
      "endMs": 680480
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "You believe me, don't you? You're my friend who believes me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681090,
      "endMs": 683190
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Sweet, trustworthy Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683610,
      "endMs": 685890
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Actually, Bart, you're kinda creepin' me out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686550,
      "endMs": 688590
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Uh, I think I'm gonna go sit, uh... w-with that foreign exchange student.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689050,
      "endMs": 693610
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Oh, guten Tag.! Would you care for a bite of my Vengelerstrasse bar?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694780,
      "endMs": 698800
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "I also have a bag of marzipan JoyJoys!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699330,
      "endMs": 701500
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "The gremlin's takin' off the wheel!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713710,
      "endMs": 714750
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Stop the bus or we're all gonna die! Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 715270,
      "endMs": 716880
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Take me bridle and lash his hands to the seat!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718210,
      "endMs": 720510
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Would you like another lick of my flavor wax?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724140,
      "endMs": 726500
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Uh, sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726950,
      "endMs": 728560
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Well, now that we're friends, Uter... how 'bout loosening these straps, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730230,
      "endMs": 734550
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Ja, das ist gut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734920,
      "endMs": 736320
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "[ Groans ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 744900,
      "endMs": 745680
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 754210,
      "endMs": 755360
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "[ All Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 756700,
      "endMs": 758130
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Hey, boy! [ Horn Blaring ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764890,
      "endMs": 766460
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Pull, Willie! Pull!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770750,
      "endMs": 771840
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "I'm doin' all the pullin', ya blouse-wearin' poodle walker!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772290,
      "endMs": 776280
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Oh, dear Lord! It's some sort of hideous monster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787490,
      "endMs": 790840
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Aw, isn't that cute? He's trying to claw my eyes out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793200,
      "endMs": 795760
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803120,
      "endMs": 803820
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Gadzooks!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804900,
      "endMs": 806330
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Look at the bus! I was right, I tell ya! I was right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807050,
      "endMs": 809550
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Right or wrong, your behavior was still disruptive, young man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809960,
      "endMs": 811850
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Perhaps spending the remainder of your life in a madhouse...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812200,
      "endMs": 814320
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "will teach you some manners. Ha-ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814690,
      "endMs": 816490
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] At least now I can get some rest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 821930,
      "endMs": 824050
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Hidilly-ho, Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825920,
      "endMs": 827720
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "We come now to the final and most terrifying painting of the evening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831270,
      "endMs": 836150
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "To even gaze upon it is to go mad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836510,
      "endMs": 839880
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "[ Shrieks ] They're dogs, and they're playing poker!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840700,
      "endMs": 844800
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Aaah! [ Crazed Laughter]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845160,
      "endMs": 848410
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "We had a story to go with this painting, but it was far too intense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850420,
      "endMs": 854240
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "So we just threw something together with vampires. Enjoy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854650,
      "endMs": 856630
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "[ Kent Brockman On TV] Another local peasant has been found dead... drained of his blood, with two teeth marks on his throat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860700,
      "endMs": 865920
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "This black cape was found on the scene. Police are baffled.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866350,
      "endMs": 870180
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "We think we're dealing with a supernatural being... most likely a mummy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870760,
      "endMs": 874800
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "As a precaution, I've ordered the Egyptian wing of the Springfield Museum destroyed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875260,
      "endMs": 878830
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Nice work, Ed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881490,
      "endMs": 882520
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "No, no, they're wrong! The creature they seek is the walking undead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882850,
      "endMs": 886470
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Nosferatu. Das Vampyr.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886960,
      "endMs": 889170
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "A vampire!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891470,
      "endMs": 893070
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] Lisa, vampires are make-believe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893480,
      "endMs": 896560
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Just like elves, gremlins and Eskimos.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896970,
      "endMs": 898660
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "In a completely unrelated story, Montgomery Burns has just closed a deal... to buy the Springfield Blood Bank.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899620,
      "endMs": 904220
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Oh, I'm very excited about this deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905230,
      "endMs": 907070
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "What? Oh. Precious blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 907550,
      "endMs": 911160
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Hmm. Business deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911560,
      "endMs": 913020
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "It sure was nice of Mr. Burns to invite us... for a midnight dinner at his country house in...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915210,
      "endMs": 919090
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Pennsylvania.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920100,
      "endMs": 922280
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Ah, there's something fishy about this whole setup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924910,
      "endMs": 926660
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Lisa, stop being so suspicious.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927120,
      "endMs": 928640
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Did everyone wash their necks like Mr. Burns asked?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 929060,
      "endMs": 931200
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Yes. Sure did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931570,
      "endMs": 933010
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "[ Doorbell Chimes ] [ Mr. Burns Over Speaker] Welcome. Come in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937710,
      "endMs": 939840
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Ah, fresh victims for my ever-growing army of the undead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940770,
      "endMs": 943140
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "[ Smithers ] Sir, you have to let go of the button. Oh, son of a bit--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943720,
      "endMs": 945680
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Well, if it isn't my good friends, the, uh--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954840,
      "endMs": 956500
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Simpson family, master. Simpson, eh? Excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956830,
      "endMs": 960340
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Dad, do you notice anything strange?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 962960,
      "endMs": 965010
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Yeah, his hairdo looks so queer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965490,
      "endMs": 967420
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I heard that! It was the boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967790,
      "endMs": 969310
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Ooh! Punch!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970930,
      "endMs": 972440
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Eww. Dad, this is blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973510,
      "endMs": 975070
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Correction-- free blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975490,
      "endMs": 976940
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Whoops. Bart and I have to go wash up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980330,
      "endMs": 983110
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "But you didn't get any on me-- Ugh-- Wh-- Lisa, Burns isn't a vampire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983620,
      "endMs": 987750
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "And even if he was, we're not gonna stumble on his secret hiding place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988070,
      "endMs": 991100
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "You're probably right. Let's just go back. [ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994960,
      "endMs": 997130
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Satisfied? Big deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001950,
      "endMs": 1003620
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "It's no different from the basement in Grampa's rest home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1003590,
      "endMs": 1005350
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Look! [ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005830,
      "endMs": 1007050
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Oh, my God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010200,
      "endMs": 1012030
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "[ Muttering ] Please, Bart. I've seen your stupid Shemp.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016470,
      "endMs": 1018180
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Nyung, nyung, nyung, nyung!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020780,
      "endMs": 1022860
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Yeah, I've seen your Curly too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1023680,
      "endMs": 1025420
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "[ Growls ] [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1025830,
      "endMs": 1028810
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "I know I really shouldn't, but when am I gonna be here again?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034290,
      "endMs": 1037230
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Whee!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038210,
      "endMs": 1039580
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "[ Growling ] [ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041440,
      "endMs": 1043370
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Well, if it isn't little--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046280,
      "endMs": 1048260
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "uh, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050030,
      "endMs": 1051110
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Mom, Dad! Mr. Burns is a vampire, and he has Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054330,
      "endMs": 1058660
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "[ Mr. Burns ] Why, Bart is right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1059110,
      "endMs": 1061800
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Hello, Mother. Hello, Father.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062180,
      "endMs": 1063750
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I missed you during my uneventful absence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064160,
      "endMs": 1066150
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Oh, Lisa, you and your stories.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066600,
      "endMs": 1068270
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "''Bart is a vampire.'' ''Beer kills brain cells.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068640,
      "endMs": 1071030
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Now, let's go back to that... building thingy... where our beds and TV... is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071460,
      "endMs": 1077990
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1085570,
      "endMs": 1087140
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Come join us, Lisa. It's so cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1087670,
      "endMs": 1090310
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "You get to stay up all night drinking blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090800,
      "endMs": 1093300
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "And if you say you're a vampire... you get a free small soda at the movies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093850,
      "endMs": 1098100
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "No! No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098460,
      "endMs": 1099860
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Lisa, it's not like you have a choice here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1100160,
      "endMs": 1102460
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Bart! How many times have I told you not to bite your sist-- [ Gasps ] Wait a minute! You are a vampire!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107390,
      "endMs": 1112720
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Quick! We have to kill the boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113190,
      "endMs": 1115570
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "How'd you know he's a vampire?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116020,
      "endMs": 1117430
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "He's a vampire? Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117740,
      "endMs": 1119440
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "[ Cackling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1121110,
      "endMs": 1121690
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Homer, we gotta do something. Today, he's drinking people's blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122110,
      "endMs": 1124430
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Tomorrow, he could be smoking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124840,
      "endMs": 1126150
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "The only way to get Bart back is to kill the head vampire...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126580,
      "endMs": 1129700
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130070,
      "endMs": 1131670
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Kill my boss? Do I dare live out the American dream?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132020,
      "endMs": 1134650
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "This is dangerous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136690,
      "endMs": 1137510
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "I wish we could have found a sitter for Maggie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138120,
      "endMs": 1139850
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "You must drive this stake right through his heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141630,
      "endMs": 1144510
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Take that, vile fiend!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150350,
      "endMs": 1151970
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Uh, Dad, that's his crotch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155330,
      "endMs": 1157430
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "[ Laughs ] Oh, sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158030,
      "endMs": 1159610
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "[ Screaming ] No! [ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161890,
      "endMs": 1165860
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "You're fired! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171640,
      "endMs": 1173510
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "It's so nice having everything back to normal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174780,
      "endMs": 1176910
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "I'm a vampire, and I've come to suck your blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177450,
      "endMs": 1181260
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Blah! Oh-- This cape is giving me a rash.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1181730,
      "endMs": 1185700
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Grampa's a vampire? We're all vampires.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1186040,
      "endMs": 1188450
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "But, no, we killed Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188820,
      "endMs": 1190430
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "You have to kill the head vampire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191230,
      "endMs": 1193040
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "You're the head vampire?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194380,
      "endMs": 1195810
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "No, I'm the head vampire.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196210,
      "endMs": 1198400
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "[ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1198870,
      "endMs": 1200830
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Mom? I do have a life outside this house, you know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201350,
      "endMs": 1204140
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "[ Screams ] [ Hissing ] Happy Halloween, everybody!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204690,
      "endMs": 1209170
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "\" [ Vocalizing: ''Hark! The Herald Angels Sing'' ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209750,
      "endMs": 1215380
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 5,
    "episode": 5
  }
}
